    "title" : "9 Wicket Lane, Whenuapai - Niseko Real Estate Photographer",
    "sourceUrl" : "",
    "body" : "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" data-updated-on=\"1730703914190\" id=\"item-67286ec42807936fec5a066f\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html\" data-block-type=\"2\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" id=\"block-e08e5f9aec32a6d85bac\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n<div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content>\n  <p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>About us:</strong> PropertyMedia Japan specializes in Real Estate Photography, Videography, Aerial Photography, Floorplans and Virtual Staging. Previously based in Queenstown New Zealand, we are now operating in Niseko, Hokkaido Japan. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Five Comfortable Bedrooms:</strong> Each bedroom is designed for relaxation and privacy, with generous space and stylish finishes that make it easy to unwind.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Two Modern Bathrooms:</strong> Featuring sleek, high-quality fixtures and a fresh design, the bathrooms provide a spa-like experience for daily routines.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Three Spacious Living Rooms:</strong> Ideal for families, these versatile living areas offer spaces for entertainment, relaxation, and everything in between, catering to both formal gatherings and casual family nights.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Contemporary Kitchen:</strong> The heart of the home, this kitchen comes fully equipped with premium appliances, ample storage, and a layout that makes meal prep and entertaining a joy.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Single-Car Garage:</strong> A secure garage provides convenience for parking and additional storage needs.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Beautiful Outdoor Area:</strong> With landscaped surroundings and ample space for outdoor dining and activities, the backyard is perfect for enjoying Whenuapai\u2019s natural charm.</p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Located in a prime Whenuapai neighborhood, 9 Wicket Lane is close to schools, parks, shopping centers, and dining options, offering the best of suburban life with urban conveniences. This property is a fantastic opportunity for families or professionals looking for a blend of space, comfort, and location in an exceptional setting.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block gallery-block sqs-block-gallery\" data-block-json=\"&#123;&quot;existingGallery&quot;:null,&quot;hSize&quot;:null,&quot;newWindow&quot;:false,&quot;floatDir&quot;:null,&quot;methodOption&quot;:&quot;transient&quot;,&quot;aspect-ratio&quot;:&quot;square&quot;,&quot;aspectRatio&quot;:null,&quot;auto-crop&quot;:true,&quot;blockAnimation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;collectionId&quot;:&quot;67286f988854d43ff8b090cc&quot;,&quot;design&quot;:&quot;stacked&quot;,&quot;lightbox&quot;:false,&quot;padding&quot;:20,&quot;show-meta&quot;:true,&quot;show-meta-basic&quot;:false,&quot;show-meta-only-title&quot;:false,&quot;show-meta-only-description&quot;:false,&quot;square-thumbs&quot;:true,&quot;thumbnails-per-row&quot;:4,&quot;vSize&quot;:null,&quot;transientGalleryId&quot;:&quot;67286f988854d43ff8b090cc&quot;&#125;\" data-block-type=\"8\" data-sqsp-block=\"gallery\" id=\"block-yui_3_17_2_1_1730696809221_241718\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n\n  \n\n  \n\n\n<div class=\"\n  sqs-gallery-container\n  sqs-gallery-block-stacked\n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n  \n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n  \n  \n\n  \n  block-animation-none\n  clear\"\n  \n  \n>\n  <div class=\"sqs-gallery\">\n    \n      \n        \n          <div clas